{"id":"782b07fc06268214","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-computable-trace.md","title":"可计算强数组迹","display":"df-computable-trace — 可计算强数组迹","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-computable-trace","aliases":["43-df-computable-trace"],"display":"df-computable-trace — 可计算强数组迹","depends_on":["[[43-df-computable]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"Def.16.1.1, printed pp.480–481 / PDF pp.500–501","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-computable-trace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-computable-trace</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-computable-trace — 可计算强数组迹"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Def.16.1.1, printed pp.480–481 / PDF pp.500–501"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\">\\(h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Computable}\">\\(\\mathrm{Computable}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f357216a7edb035a\" href=\"?note=f357216a7edb035a\" title=\"43-df-computable\">43-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_a:=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N: \\lfloor a/2^i\\rfloor\\equiv1\\pmod 2\\}\\qquad(a\\in\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_a:=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N: \\lfloor a/2^i\\rfloor\\equiv1\\pmod 2\\}\\qquad(a\\in\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ComputableTrace}(g,f,h)\\iff\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;|D_{g(x)}|\\le h(x)\\right)\\land\\forall(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\;y\\in D_{g(x)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ComputableTrace}(g,f,h)\\iff\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;|D_{g(x)}|\\le h(x)\\right)\\land\\forall(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\;y\\in D_{g(x)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>使用有限集规范代码而非仅“可判定二元关系且各纤维有限”：后者不能自动提供统一可计算的最大元。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"f357216a7edb035a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N$，$h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$。$\\mathrm{Computable}$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\rightharpoonup\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}","display":false},{"tex":"g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Computable}","display":false},{"tex":"D_a:=\\{i\\in\\mathbb N: \\lfloor a/2^i\\rfloor\\equiv1\\pmod 2\\}\\qquad(a\\in\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ComputableTrace}(g,f,h)\\iff\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\left(\\forall x\\in\\mathbb N\\;|D_{g(x)}|\\le h(x)\\right)\\land\\forall(x,y)\\in\\operatorname{graph}(f)\\;y\\in D_{g(x)}.","display":true}],"bytes":1270,"backlinks":[{"id":"abd2ac3cf0e63c86","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Order}$ 见 [[43-df-order-function]]；$\\mathrm{ComputableTrace}$ 见 [[43-df-computable-trace]]；$\\mathrm{Computable}^A$ 见 [[43-df-computable]]。"},{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-341","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-computable-trace]] — 可计算强数组迹"},{"id":"068ed3bb67d8295c","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{ComputablyTraceable}$、$\\mathrm{ComputableTrace}$、$\\operatorname{Order}$、$\\operatorname{Computable}^A$ 见 [[43-df-computably-traceable]]、[[43-df-computable-trace]]、[[43-df-order-function]]、[[43-df-computable]]。$h:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{>0}$，$f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$。"}],"outgoing":["f357216a7edb035a"]}